flowchart TB
    U[Visitor / User Browser] --> EDGE[CDN + WAF]
    A[Admin Browser] --> EDGE
    EDGE --> WEB[Web App: Public + User + Admin]
    WEB --> API[API Gateway / Modular Backend]

    API --> AUTH[Identity, RBAC, Consent]
    API --> FUND[Fund Catalogue + Analytics]
    API --> CALC[What-If + SIP Backtest Engine]
    API --> BILL[Subscription & Billing]
    API --> AI[AI Gateway + Grounded Retrieval]
    API --> ADMIN[Admin + Audit]

    AUTH --> DB[(Managed PostgreSQL)]
    FUND --> DB
    CALC --> DB
    BILL --> DB
    ADMIN --> DB
    API --> CACHE[(Redis Cache)]

    NAVSRC[NAV Provider / Admin CSV-XLSX] --> OBJ[(Object Storage: Raw Files)]
    OBJ --> Q[Job Queue]
    Q --> INGEST[NAV Ingestion + Validation Workers]
    INGEST --> STAGE[(Staging Tables)]
    STAGE --> DB

    ADMIN --> PUB[SIP Date Draft / Approval / Publish]
    PUB --> DB
    DB --> NQ[Notification Queue]
    NQ --> NW[Notification Workers]
    NW --> SMS[SMS / DLT Provider]
    NW --> EMAIL[Email Provider]
    NW --> PUSH[Web Push Provider]

    BILL --> PG[Hosted Payment Gateway]
    PG --> WH[Signed Webhook Endpoint]
    WH --> BILL

    AI --> MODEL[LLM Provider]
    AI --> RAG[Approved Fund Facts + Calculation Results]

    API --> OBS[Logs / Metrics / Traces / Alerts]
    INGEST --> OBS
    NW --> OBS
    WH --> OBS
